<title>USA: USDA says CCC interest rates unchanged in Jan.</title>
<headline>USDA says CCC interest rates unchanged in Jan.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Agriculture Department said Thursday the interest rate for 1996 crop year commodity loans disbursed by Commodity Credit Corp (CCC) in January is 6.5 percent, unchanged from December's rate.</p>
<p>USDA said the January rate for 1995 and prior corp year commodity loans is 5.5 percent, also unchanged from the prior month.</p>
</text>
